WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Oil pressure relief valve
What it does: Limits excessive pressure by opening a relief path when pressure overcomes the spring.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Oil pressure relief valve
How it works: If it exceeds the closing force, the relief path opens.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Oil pressure relief valve
How it moves: The plunger moves as the balance between oil pressure and spring force changes.
